    {
      "id": 35,
      "type": "bargauge",
      "title": "Notificaciones por entrega",
      "description": "Notificaciones creadas dentro del rango del dashboard: live = llegó al usuario conectado, stored_only = quedó guardada porque no estaba conectado.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${datasource}"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 4,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 6,
        "y": 23
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "decimals": 0,
          "min": 0,
          "noValue": "0",
          "color": {
            "mode": "fixed",
            "fixedColor": "blue"
          }
        },
        "overrides": [
          {
            "matcher": {
              "id": "byName",
              "options": "live"
            },
            "properties": [
              {
                "id": "color",
                "value": {
                  "mode": "fixed",
                  "fixedColor": "green"
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "matcher": {
              "id": "byName",
              "options": "stored_only"
            },
            "properties": [
              {
                "id": "color",
                "value": {
                  "mode": "fixed",
                  "fixedColor": "blue"
                }
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ],
          "fields": "",
          "values": false
        },
        "orientation": "horizontal",
        "displayMode": "basic",
        "valueMode": "text",
        "namePlacement": "left",
        "showUnfilled": true,
        "sizing": "manual",
        "minVizHeight": 18,
        "maxVizHeight": 36,
        "minVizWidth": 8,
        "text": {
          "titleSize": 13,
          "valueSize": 20
        }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${datasource}"
          },
          "expr": "sum by (delivery) (round(increase(notifications_created_total[$__range])))",
          "legendFormat": "{{delivery}}",
          "instant": true,
          "range": false
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 43,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "% en vivo",
      "description": "Porcentaje de las notificaciones del período que llegaron al usuario conectado en el momento (live) sobre el total (live + stored_only). Si baja, los usuarios no están conectados cuando se dispara su alerta y la notificación queda guardada en la bandeja. Verde desde el 80 %, amarillo desde el 50 %, rojo por debajo.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${datasource}"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 4,
        "w": 6,
        "x": 18,
        "y": 23
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "percentunit",
          "decimals": 1,
          "noValue": "sin datos",
          "color": {
            "mode": "thresholds"
          },
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "value": null,
                "color": "red"
              },
              {
                "value": 0.5,
                "color": "yellow"
              },
              {
                "value": 0.8,
                "color": "green"
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ],
          "fields": "",
          "values": false
        },
        "colorMode": "background",
        "graphMode": "none",
        "textMode": "value",
        "orientation": "auto"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${datasource}"
          },
          "expr": "sum(increase(notifications_created_total{delivery=\"live\"}[$__range])) / sum(increase(notifications_created_total[$__range]))",
          "legendFormat": "en vivo",
          "instant": true,
          "range": false
        }
      ]
    },
    {
